Z||000009||sluppy123||11-21-2001||09:12 PM||||The only complete turbo system that would bolt directly up to the 2.8 would be from a Early 90's turbo grand prix(not sure of the year) The problem with this is they didn't make very many of these cars, parts are hard to find, Plus you'd still need to do some riging to the exhaust.<P>As far as my install goes, I used a garret T-3 with a .63 A/R. I've logged a little of 3k miles with the only problem being a exhaust leak in the crossover, warped my turbo mounting flange, Remilled and it's good as new. ||||reg||1
